#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:4
msgid "Dynamic transformers"
msgstr "动态转换器"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:6
msgid ""
"In conventional chemometrics practice, preprocessing is treated as a "
"**static** operation: a correction is determined from a calibration set "
"and then applied uniformly to every new spectrum. The preprocessing step "
"holds everything it needs — a stored mean spectrum, a fitted baseline, a "
"set of PLS loadings — and the data alone is sufficient at prediction "
"time."
msgstr "在传统化学计量学实践中，预处理被视为一种**静态**操作：先根据校准集确定校正方式，再将其统一应用于每条新光谱。预处理步骤保存了所需的一切信息，例如已存储的平均光谱、拟合后的基线和一组 PLS 载荷，因此预测时仅凭数据本身即可完成处理。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:12
msgid ""
"This works well for a large class of problems, but it breaks down when "
"the correction you need to apply depends on **information that is only "
"available at inference time**. In practice this information falls into "
"two categories:"
msgstr "这种方式适用于很多问题，但当所需校正依赖于**仅在推理时才可获得的信息**时便不再适用。实践中，这类信息分为两类："

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Measurement metadata** — instrument-level quantities recorded alongside"
" the spectrum but not part of it: the x-axis calibration, laser power, "
"integration time, detector temperature."
msgstr "**测量元数据**——与光谱同时记录、但不属于光谱本身的仪器级量值：x 轴校准、激光功率、积分时间、检测器温度。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Process data** — sample- or batch-level context that changes between "
"runs or samples: a fresh background measurement, a dilution factor, a "
"reference standard collected just before the sample or other process "
"parameters such as temperature or humidity."
msgstr "**过程数据**——随运行或样本变化的样本级或批次级上下文：最新的背景测量、稀释因子、在样本之前采集的参考标准，或温度、湿度等其他过程参数。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:24
msgid "Some concrete examples from spectroscopy:"
msgstr "以下是光谱学中的一些具体示例："

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:26
msgid ""
"The **x-axis grid** of the instrument drifted between calibration and "
"deployment. Each new spectrum arrives on a slightly different wavenumber "
"array."
msgstr "仪器的 **x 轴网格**在校准与部署之间发生漂移。每条新光谱对应的波数数组都略有不同。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:29
msgid ""
"You want to **normalize by laser power** or integration time, values that"
" are logged per measurement but are not part of the spectrum itself."
msgstr "需要按激光功率或积分时间**进行归一化**；这些值会随每次测量记录，但不属于光谱本身。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:31
msgid ""
"A **background spectrum** is measured fresh before each sample batch and "
"must be subtracted at inference, not at fit time."
msgstr "每批样本测量前都会重新测量一条**背景光谱**，因此必须在推理时而非拟合时将其减去。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:34
msgid ""
"``chemotools`` addresses this with a set of *dynamic transformers*: "
"estimators that accept additional **per-call parameters** alongside ``X``"
" at transform time, delivered through `scikit-learn's metadata routing "
"framework <https://scikit-learn.org/stable/metadata_routing.html>`_."
msgstr "``chemotools`` 通过一组*动态转换器*解决此问题：这些估计器在转换时除 ``X`` 外还接受额外的**逐次调用参数**，参数通过 `scikit-learn 的元数据路由框架 <https://scikit-learn.org/stable/metadata_routing.html>`_ 传递。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:39
msgid "Dynamic transformers in ``chemotools``"
msgstr "``chemotools`` 中的动态转换器"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:43
msgid "Transformer"
msgstr "转换器"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:44
msgid "Metadata"
msgstr "元数据"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:45
msgid "Choose it when"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:46
msgid ":class:`~chemotools.adaptation.XAxisInterpolator`"
msgstr ":class:`~chemotools.adaptation.XAxisInterpolator`"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:47
msgid "``x_axis``"
msgstr "``x_axis``"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:48
msgid "Spectra must be resampled from changing input grids onto one fixed grid."
msgstr "需要将光谱从不断变化的输入网格重采样到一个固定网格。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:49
msgid ":class:`~chemotools.adaptation.MetadataFunctionTransformer`"
msgstr ":class:`~chemotools.adaptation.MetadataFunctionTransformer`"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:50
msgid "User-defined names"
msgstr "用户定义的名称"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:51
msgid "A custom correction needs one or more values that change between calls."
msgstr "自定义校正需要一个或多个随调用而变化的值。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:53
msgid ""
"The distinction is useful: "
":class:`~chemotools.adaptation.XAxisInterpolator` is a specialized, fully"
" validated interpolation estimator, while "
":class:`~chemotools.adaptation.MetadataFunctionTransformer` adapts a "
"regular Python function to scikit-learn's estimator and metadata-routing "
"interfaces. Use the specialized transformer for x-axis alignment. Use the"
" function wrapper for operations such as reference subtraction, intensity"
" scaling, offsets, or domain-specific corrections."
msgstr "二者的区别很实用：:class:`~chemotools.adaptation.XAxisInterpolator` 是专用且经过完整验证的插值估计器，而 :class:`~chemotools.adaptation.MetadataFunctionTransformer` 将普通 Python 函数适配为 scikit-learn 的估计器和元数据路由接口。x 轴对齐应使用专用转换器；参考扣除、强度缩放、偏移或特定领域校正等操作则使用函数包装器。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:62
msgid "XAxisInterpolator: align spectra to a common grid"
msgstr "XAxisInterpolator：将光谱对齐到统一网格"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:64
msgid ""
"In Raman spectroscopy, each instrument has a slightly different pixel-to-"
"wavenumber calibration. Spectra from different instruments share the same"
" chemistry but arrive on different x-axis grids — so they cannot be "
"stacked into a matrix until they are resampled onto a common one."
msgstr "在拉曼光谱中，每台仪器的像素到波数校准都略有不同。不同仪器所得光谱反映相同的化学信息，却位于不同的 x 轴网格上，因此必须先重采样到统一网格，才能堆叠成矩阵。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:69
msgid ""
"Five simulated spectra, each with a Gaussian peak at 1100 cm⁻¹ but on a "
"slightly different grid, illustrate the problem."
msgstr "以下五条模拟光谱各自在 1100 cm⁻¹ 处有一个高斯峰，但所在网格略有不同，借此说明这一问题。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:72
msgid "**Setting up the data**"
msgstr "**准备数据**"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:99
msgid "**Step 1 — what the instrument gives you**"
msgstr "**步骤 1——仪器提供的数据**"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:101
msgid ""
"Each spectrum is delivered as an array of intensity values indexed by "
"pixel number. When you plot them on a common pixel axis, the peaks appear"
" at different positions — each instrument's zero point is slightly "
"different."
msgstr "每条光谱都以按像素编号索引的强度值数组形式提供。将它们绘制在统一的像素轴上时，各峰出现在不同位置，因为每台仪器的零点略有不同。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:117
msgid "Raw spectra indexed by pixel number — peaks at different positions"
msgstr "按像素编号索引的原始光谱——峰位不同"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:124
msgid ""
"Peaks land at different pixel positions — the grids are misaligned. If "
"you stacked these rows into a matrix as-is and fed it to a PLS model, "
"column *k* would represent a different wavenumber for each instrument, so"
" every learned regression coefficient would point at the wrong feature."
msgstr "各峰落在不同的像素位置，说明网格未对齐。如果直接将这些行堆叠成矩阵并输入 PLS 模型，则第 *k* 列对每台仪器代表的波数都不同，因而学习到的每个回归系数都会指向错误的特征。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:129
msgid "**Step 2 — plot against wavenumber**"
msgstr "**步骤 2——以波数为横轴绘图**"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:131
msgid ""
"Each spectrum comes with its own wavenumber axis. Plotting against it "
"shows the peaks coincide at 1100 cm⁻¹, but the arrays are still all "
"different."
msgstr "每条光谱都有自己的波数轴。以各自波数轴绘图可见，各峰均位于 1100 cm⁻¹，但数组仍各不相同。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:145
msgid "Raw spectra on their own wavenumber axes — peaks align at 1100 cm⁻¹"
msgstr "位于各自波数轴上的原始光谱——峰在 1100 cm⁻¹ 处对齐"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:152
msgid "**Step 3 — interpolate onto a common grid**"
msgstr "**步骤 3——插值到统一网格**"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:154
msgid ""
":class:`~chemotools.adaptation.XAxisInterpolator` takes a "
"``common_x_axis`` defined once at construction time and, at every "
"``transform`` call, resamples each row from its own ``x_axis`` onto that "
"shared grid. The per-spectrum axis is passed as metadata — not baked into"
" the transformer — so it can change freely between calls."
msgstr ":class:`~chemotools.adaptation.XAxisInterpolator` 接受构造时一次性定义的 ``common_x_axis``，并在每次调用 ``transform`` 时将每一行从其自身的 ``x_axis`` 重采样到该共享网格。每条光谱的坐标轴作为元数据传入，而非固化在转换器中，因此可在不同调用之间自由变化。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:188
msgid "Aligned spectra on the common grid — peaks overlap perfectly"
msgstr "统一网格上对齐后的光谱——峰完全重合"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:195
msgid ""
"All five peaks now sit at the same column index. The matrix "
"``aligned_spectra`` can be fed directly into any subsequent step or "
"model."
msgstr "现在五个峰均位于同一列索引。矩阵 ``aligned_spectra`` 可直接输入任何后续步骤或模型。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:199
msgid "Route ``x_axis`` through a Pipeline"
msgstr "通过管道路由 ``x_axis``"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:201
msgid ""
"The two method calls on the interpolator — "
"``set_fit_request(x_axis=True)`` and "
"``set_transform_request(x_axis=True)`` — register ``x_axis`` as a "
"metadata argument for the ``fit`` and ``transform`` phases respectively. "
"When you pass ``x_axis`` to a pipeline call, scikit-learn delivers it "
"only to the step that declared it; every other step is unaffected."
msgstr "对插值器调用 ``set_fit_request(x_axis=True)`` 和 ``set_transform_request(x_axis=True)``，会分别将 ``x_axis`` 注册为 ``fit`` 和 ``transform`` 阶段的元数据参数。向管道调用传入 ``x_axis`` 时，scikit-learn 只会将其交给已声明该参数的步骤，其他步骤不受影响。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:207
msgid ""
"``set_fit_request`` covers ``fit`` and ``fit_transform``; "
"``set_transform_request`` covers ``transform``. Both are declared in the "
"example because a :class:`~sklearn.pipeline.Pipeline` calling "
"``fit_transform`` routes metadata through both phases."
msgstr "``set_fit_request`` 适用于 ``fit`` 和 ``fit_transform``；``set_transform_request`` 适用于 ``transform``。示例中同时声明二者，是因为 :class:`~sklearn.pipeline.Pipeline` 调用 ``fit_transform`` 时会在两个阶段路由元数据。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:213
msgid "Using it inside a Pipeline"
msgstr "在管道中使用"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:215
msgid "The pipeline below continues from the same variables defined above:"
msgstr "下面的管道沿用上文定义的变量："

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:243
msgid ""
"Only the step that declared ``set_transform_request(x_axis=True)`` "
"receives ``x_axis``. The other steps in the pipeline are unaffected."
msgstr "只有声明了 ``set_transform_request(x_axis=True)`` 的步骤会收到 ``x_axis``。管道中的其他步骤不受影响。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:247
msgid "Shared vs. per-sample grids"
msgstr "共享网格与逐样本网格"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:249
msgid ""
"Not every batch comes from multiple instruments. When all spectra in a "
"call share the same grid, you can pass a single 1-D array instead of a "
"matrix. ``x_axis`` accepts two shapes:"
msgstr "并非每个批次都来自多台仪器。当一次调用中的所有光谱共享同一网格时，可以传入单个一维数组而非矩阵。``x_axis`` 接受两种形状："

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:253
msgid ""
"**Shape** ``(n_features,)`` — the same grid for every spectrum in the "
"call. Use this when all spectra in a batch come from the same instrument "
"(e.g., a single measurement session where the grid is fixed)."
msgstr "**形状** ``(n_features,)``——本次调用中的每条光谱使用同一网格。当一个批次的所有光谱均来自同一台仪器时使用（例如网格固定的单次测量会话）。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:257
msgid ""
"**Shape** ``(n_samples, n_features)`` — one grid per row. Use this when "
"combining spectra from multiple instruments in one batch (as in the "
"example above, where each of the five spectra has its own offset)."
msgstr "**形状** ``(n_samples, n_features)``——每行使用一个网格。当一个批次合并来自多台仪器的光谱时使用（如上例中五条光谱各自具有不同偏移）。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:271
msgid "Interpolation methods"
msgstr "插值方法"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:273
msgid ""
":class:`~chemotools.adaptation.XAxisInterpolator` supports three methods,"
" selectable via the ``method`` parameter:"
msgstr ":class:`~chemotools.adaptation.XAxisInterpolator` 支持三种方法，可通过 ``method`` 参数选择："

