msgid "When to use"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:283
msgid "``\"linear\"``"
msgstr "``\"linear\"``"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:284
msgid "Piecewise linear interpolation."
msgstr "分段线性插值。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:285
msgid "Fast; best when spectra are smooth and grids are closely spaced."
msgstr "速度快；最适合光谱平滑且网格间距较小的情况。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:286
msgid "``\"cubic\"``"
msgstr "``\"cubic\"``"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:287
msgid "Natural cubic spline (via :func:`scipy.interpolate.CubicSpline`)."
msgstr "自然三次样条（通过 :func:`scipy.interpolate.CubicSpline`）。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:288
msgid "Good all-round choice; smooth and accurate."
msgstr "平滑且准确，是综合表现良好的选择。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:289
msgid "``\"pchip\"``"
msgstr "``\"pchip\"``"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:290
msgid "Piecewise cubic Hermite (via :func:`scipy.interpolate.PchipInterpolator`)."
msgstr "分段三次 Hermite 插值（通过 :func:`scipy.interpolate.PchipInterpolator`）。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:291
msgid "Preserves monotonicity; avoids overshooting near peaks."
msgstr "保持单调性；避免峰附近出现过冲。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:293
msgid ""
"Points outside the input grid are filled with ``left`` / ``right`` (both "
"default to :data:`numpy.nan`). You can change these to ``0.0`` or any "
"other sentinel value if your downstream steps cannot handle ``NaN``."
msgstr "输入网格之外的点使用 ``left`` / ``right`` 填充（二者默认为 :data:`numpy.nan`）。如果下游步骤无法处理 ``NaN``，可将其改为 ``0.0`` 或其他哨兵值。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:299
msgid "MetadataFunctionTransformer: build a dynamic correction"
msgstr "MetadataFunctionTransformer：构建动态校正"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:301
msgid ""
":class:`~chemotools.adaptation.MetadataFunctionTransformer` turns a "
"Python function into a scikit-learn transformer that can receive named "
"metadata. It is useful when the mathematical operation is simple, but one"
" or more operands are only known when a batch is transformed."
msgstr ":class:`~chemotools.adaptation.MetadataFunctionTransformer` 可将 Python 函数转换为能够接收具名元数据的 scikit-learn 转换器。当数学运算本身很简单，但一个或多个操作数仅在转换批次时才能确定，它会非常有用。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:306
msgid ""
"Consider background subtraction. A new reference spectrum is collected "
"before each measurement batch, so it cannot be stored permanently when "
"the model is trained. The operation itself is only ``X - reference``. The"
" wrapper supplies the estimator interface and routes ``reference`` to "
"that operation at the right time."
msgstr "以背景扣除为例。每个测量批次之前都会采集新的参考光谱，因此无法在训练模型时将其永久存储。运算本身只是 ``X - reference``。包装器提供估计器接口，并在适当时机将 ``reference`` 路由到该运算。"

