"unexpected side effects. It also reflects the central use case: metadata "
"values available during deployment may differ from those seen while the "
"pipeline is fitted."
msgstr "在 ``fit`` 期间不执行函数，可避免重复工作和意外副作用。这也符合其核心用例：部署时可用的元数据值可能与管道拟合时看到的值不同。"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:635
msgid ""
"With the default ``validate=True``, ``X`` is converted to a finite "
"numeric two-dimensional array and its feature count is checked against "
"the fitted input. Set ``validate=False`` only when the function must "
"receive another data container unchanged and performs its own input "
"validation. Output validation is always the responsibility of the "
"function."
